      "body": "Related to #47242.\n\n## Motivation\n\nSGLang 0.5.22 accepts Python 3.13, but its `outlines==0.1.11` dependency pins `outlines_core==0.1.26`, which has no CPython 3.13 wheel. Installation therefore falls back to a Rust source build and can fail with `can't find Rust compiler`. The installation page currently says Python 3.11 or higher without explaining this prerequisite.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- Surface the Python 3.13 source-build requirement before the pip/uv installation commands.\n- Explain the dependency pin chain and the missing-wheel error in troubleshooting.\n- Show a separate Python 3.12 environment as a way to avoid this dependency's source build, and link the official Rust installation guide for users who need Python 3.13.\n\nThis is a documentation follow-up. It does not upgrade Outlines, establish full Python 3.13 runtime compatibility, or resolve the dependency-packaging issue.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Independently checked the pins in `python/pyproject.toml` and PyPI release metadata.\n- Cross-target `pip download --no-deps --only-binary=:all: --platform manylinux2014_x86_64 --implementation cp` for `outlines_core==0.1.26`: CPython 3.12 succeeds; CPython 3.13 fails with no matching distribution, as expected.\n- `git diff --check` passes.\n- Relevant `pre-commit-hooks==6.0.0` checks (trailing whitespace, final newline, merge-conflict markers, private keys) and `codespell==2.4.1` pass on the changed page.\n- `mint@4.2.559 validate` passes on the documentation site in an isolated Linux directory.\n- `mint@4.2.559 broken-links --check-anchors --check-redirects` passes with no broken links.\n- `pre-commit run --files docs/docs/get-started/install.mdx` passes in the isolated Linux environment: all applicable checks pass; hooks for other file types are skipped.\n- No full SGLang installation, Rust compilation, model accuracy evaluation, or GPU inference was run for this docs-only change.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNot applicable: no runtime or model changes.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNot applicable: no runtime or model changes.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Pre-commit checks for the changed page.\n- [x] Mintlify build validation.\n- [x] Mintlify anchor/redirect link check.\n- [x] Update the existing installation documentation.\n- [x] Check the documented dependency pins and wheel availability.\n- [x] Follow the documentation style guide.\n\nAI assistance: this contribution was prepared with OpenAI Codex. The validation above describes the checks actually performed; human review is pending.\n",
